CPEDAL 1
NAME "BearFoot Blueberry Bass Overdrive Reference Draft"

# Reconstructed directly from the supplied BJFE Blueberry Bass Overdrive #045
# trace by JFace. This is deliberately not the different Mad Professor circuit:
# there is no input JFET, Drive is A370k, and Tone shapes the output treble
# through the unusual two-sided network around the op-amp feedback/output path.
#
# The CA3130 external 100 pF compensation capacitor is absorbed into the compact
# CA3130 dynamic model because the current op-amp primitive does not expose pins
# 1 and 8. Power LED/protection parts are omitted from the signal-path model.

V VRAW VRAW 0 9
R R15 VRAW VA 51
C C12 VA 0 100u
AUDIO GUITAR INPUT 0 0.20

# 4.5 V reference and input network.
R R4 VA VB 47k
R R2 VB 0 47k
C C1 VB 0 22u
R R1 INPUT 0 1M
C C2 INPUT INPUT_BIAS 22n
R R3 VB INPUT_BIAS 360k
R R5 INPUT_BIAS OP_PLUS 14k7

# CA3130 voltage-amplifier stage.
OPAMP U1 OP_PLUS OP_MINUS OP_OUT VA 0 CA3130EZ

# Antiparallel red LEDs and the exact A370k Drive feedback network.
D LED1 OP_MINUS OP_OUT LED_RED
D LED2 OP_OUT OP_MINUS LED_RED
R R7 OP_MINUS DRIVE_LOW 3k
POT DRIVE DRIVE_LOW OP_OUT OP_OUT 370k LOG 0.55

# Low-frequency feedback leg shared with the left side of Tone.
R R6 OP_MINUS LOW_FB 1k
C C3 LOW_FB 0 220n

# Post-op-amp 1N4007 clamp and frequency-dependent feedback branches.
R R8 OP_OUT POST_COUPLE 1k
C C5 POST_COUPLE CLAMP_A 1u
D D1 CLAMP_A 0 1N4007
D D2 0 CLAMP_A 1N4007
C C7 CLAMP_A FB_A 22n
R R9 FB_A OP_MINUS 27k
R R10 CLAMP_A CLAMP_B 10k
C C9 CLAMP_B 0 22n
C C8 CLAMP_B FB_B 4n7
R R11 FB_B OP_MINUS 147k

# BF244A common-source output stage from the BJFE trace.
C C10 CLAMP_B Q1G 22n
R R12 Q1G 0 1M
JFET Q1 Q1D Q1G Q1S BF244A
R R13 VA Q1D 5k6
R R14 Q1S 0 2k6

# BJFE Tone: wiper grounded, 22 uF side connected to the op-amp feedback
# network, and 2.2 nF side connected to the final signal node. This is not the
# source-bypass/Nature topology used by the Mad Professor incarnation.
C C6 LOW_FB TONE_1 22u
POT TONE TONE_1 0 TONE_3 50k LOG 0.50

# Drain coupling, treble-shaping connection, and linear output level.
C C13 Q1D OUTPUT_PRE 1u
R R16 OUTPUT_PRE LEVEL_TOP 27k
C C11 TONE_3 LEVEL_TOP 2n2
POT VOLUME 0 OUT LEVEL_TOP 50k LIN 0.55
R R_OUT_LOAD OUT 0 1M

OUTPUT OUT 0.5
